                      ( openbus_test.asm):00080         ; DoReads - the reads (the instructions as written: their bytes and cycles decide what a floating
                      ( openbus_test.asm):00081         ; bus holds; Draw_VLp, the BIOS vector list routine, uses LDD 1,X / LDA ,X / LDB ,X+)
